{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24384","headline":"因梦得酬牛相公初到洛中小饮见赠 · 白居易","name":"因梦得酬牛相公初到洛中小饮见赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"淮南挥手抛红斾，洛下回头向白云。\n政事堂中老丞相，制科场里旧将军。\n宫城烟月饶全占，关塞风光请半分。\n诗酒放狂犹得在，莫欺白叟与刘君。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24384.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24384","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}